---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Quiz Parade — Family Trivia"
  description="Quiz Parade is a family-friendly trivia game for iPhone with a new Daily Quiz every morning, themed question packs, and Game Center leaderboards."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <span class="section-label">// quiz parade</span>
      <h1>A new Daily Quiz<br />every morning.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Quiz Parade is a bright, family-friendly trivia game for iPhone. Play the Daily Quiz, work through
        themed packs on geography, science, flags and more, and see how you stack up on the leaderboards.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@quizparade" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Watch on YouTube
        </a>
        <a href="/apps/quizparade/privacy" class="btn btn-outline">Privacy Policy</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">Coming soon to iPhone.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">// features</span>
        <h2>Quick to play, fun to share</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#128197;</div>
          <h3>Daily Quiz</h3>
          <p>
            A fresh pair of questions every day. The first is also turned into a short video for
            YouTube; the second is only in the app.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#127758;</div>
          <h3>Themed Packs</h3>
          <p>
            Geography, science, flags, general knowledge and family favorites, with new packs
            arriving over time without an app update.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#127942;</div>
          <h3>Leaderboards</h3>
          <p>
            Compare scores with friends through Game Center. Signing in is optional; the game works
            the same without it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#9989;</div>
          <h3>Checked Questions</h3>
          <p>
            Every Daily Quiz question is fact-checked against a published source before it is released.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#128106;</div>
          <h3>Family-Friendly</h3>
          <p>
            Evergreen, family-safe trivia that grown-ups and kids can play together.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">&#128274;</div>
          <h3>No Account</h3>
          <p>
            No sign-up and no personal information. Your scores and stats stay on your device.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Support -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container support-content">
      <span class="section-label">// support</span>
      <h2>Need help with Quiz Parade?</h2>
      <p>
        Send a note with your device model, iOS version and what happened. If a question looks wrong,
        tell us which pack or Daily date it was in and we will check it.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:matt@mattdonders.com?subject=Quiz%20Parade%20Support" class="btn btn-primary">Email Support</a>

      <h3>Where do new Daily Quizzes come from?</h3>
      <p>
        Each Daily is prepared in advance, checked against published sources, and released in the app
        every day.
      </p>

      <h3>How do I turn the daily reminder on or off?</h3>
      <p>
        The reminder is off by default. Turn it on or off in Quiz Parade's Settings. If notifications are
        disabled for Quiz Parade in the iOS Settings app, enable them there too.
      </p>

      <h3>Do I need a Game Center account?</h3>
      <p>
        No. Game Center is only used for leaderboards. Without it, every quiz and your on-device stats
        still work.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bottom CTA -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container bottom-cta">
      <p>Follow along for a new quiz question every day.</p>
      <div class="cta-btns">
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@quizparade" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Quiz Parade on YouTube
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    padding: 6rem 0 5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-lg {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* Features */
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Section alt */
  .section-alt {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  /* Pricing */
  .pricing-sub {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pricing-card {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .pricing-card-premium {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-dim);
  }

  .pricing-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .price {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .price-note {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .pricing-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .pricing-card li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 0.35rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .pricing-card li::before {
    content: '\2713';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--success);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Bottom CTA */
  .bottom-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .bottom-cta p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-btns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Mobile */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero { padding: 3rem 0 3rem; }
    .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .hero-note { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-subtle); }
  .support-content { max-width: 680px; }
  .support-content h3 { margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .support-content p { margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; }
</style>
